ent\\\": \\\"You eat breakfast.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You don't eat breakfast.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Do you eat breakfast?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He / She / It\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He likes Toronto.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He doesn't like Toronto.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Does he like Toronto?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"We\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"We go to the gym.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"We don't go to the gym.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Do we go to the gym?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"They\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"They watch TV.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"They don't watch TV.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Do they watch TV?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Use information about locations of things to interact with others."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands simple information, vocabulary and expressions in short conversations about personal information."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Provides simple personal information in written texts and spoken form through simple comprehensible phrases."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Provides simple personal information in written texts and spoken form through simple comprehensible phrases."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands simple information, vocabulary and expressions in short conversations about personal information."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands simple information, vocabulary an